    - target: {fileID: 7840051006733746589, guid: 864fbbe3ac0a1ad4ab85979a09fba319, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_SpriteTilingProperty.oldSize.x
      value: 7.33
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7840051006733746589, guid: 864fbbe3ac0a1ad4ab85979a09fba319, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_SpriteTilingProperty.oldSize.y
      value: 9.07
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8282435382529470039, guid: 864fbbe3ac0a1ad4ab85979a09fba319, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueUI
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 188813552}
    - target: {fileID: 8282435382529470039, guid: 864fbbe3ac0a1ad4ab85979a09fba319, type: 3}
      propertyPath: closingLine.text
      value: The beast I fled from... Fast, it is. From the darkness, it stalks.
        Careful, you must be.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8282435382529470039, guid: 864fbbe3ac0a1ad4ab85979a09fba319, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.size
      value: 5
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8282435382529470039, guid: 864fbbe3ac0a1ad4ab85979a09fba319, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[1].text
      value: Who's there...? A visitor, hmm. Not so bad... Without my brothers, company
        is welcome. If hostile, you are not.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8282435382529470039, guid: 864fbbe3ac0a1ad4ab85979a09fba319, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[2].text
      value: Brothers alive? Still out there, they are...? Hope, I had almost lost.Life,
        you have brought back to me... Grateful, I am. In return, give tip I will..
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8282435382529470039, guid: 864fbbe3ac0a1ad4ab85979a09fba319, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[3].text
      value: Powerful, the beasts here are. Shatter pillars, they can. Avoid them,
        you must. Mercy, they know not. Faster than you, they are. Running... pointless,
        it is.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8282435382529470039, guid: 864fbbe3ac0a1ad4ab85979a09fba319, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[4].text
      value: The gate, your way out, it is. Four keys, you need. One, I have. Take
        it, you should. Greater need of it, you have. My brothers... I must find
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8282435382529470039, guid: 864fbbe3ac0a1ad4ab85979a09fba319, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[3].sound
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 2a909d225a5afea41962f6d738bd4ce6, type: 3}
    - target: {fileID: 8282435382529470039, guid: 864fbbe3ac0a1ad4ab85979a09fba319, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[4].sound
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 2a909d225a5afea41962f6d738bd4ce6, type: 3}
